API to PostgreSQL ETL Pipeline
Project Overview
Developed an ETL pipeline that extracts customer data from a REST API, validates and transforms JSON responses, loads the data into PostgreSQL, and generates business reports using SQL queries and joins.

Technologies Used
Python
PostgreSQL
Requests
Psycopg2
SQL
Workflow
REST API ↓ Extract Data ↓ Validate Data ↓ Transform Data ↓ Load into PostgreSQL ↓ SQL Queries & Joins ↓ Business Reports

Features
API Data Extraction
Data Validation
Data Transformation
PostgreSQL Data Loading
Business Reporting
SQL Joins
Logging
How to Run
Create database sales_db
Execute table creation scripts
Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
